"Every packages uses the official Instructure design tokens, components, and "
"interactions from <a href=\"https://instructure.design\" "
"target=\"_blank\">InstUI</a>."
msgstr ""

#: index.md:27
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "Bruk den minste pakken"

#: index.md:28
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install just <code>@pantoken/css</code> for a stylesheet, <code>@pantoken/"
"pendo</code> for guides, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr ""
"Installer bare @pantoken/css for et stilark, @pantoken/react for hooks og "
"ikoner, eller et bundler-preset for Tailwind, Panda eller MUI."

#: index.md:32
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "Generer for alle plattformer"

#: index.md:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Install the pantoken cli to generate presets or add components for any "
"platform&colon; web, native, and anything in between."
msgstr ""

#: index.md:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "No React needed"
msgstr ""

#: index.md:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The InstUI library is tightly coupled with React. If you want to use it, you "
"have to use React. Now you can build anywhere."
msgstr ""

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
#~ msgstr "InstUI, overalt"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream "
#~ "and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Hvert pakke leser samme løste token-IR. Endre en token oppstrøms, så "
#~ "flyter den til CSS, SCSS, native kode og Figma på samme måte."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, "
#~ "WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Kjør `pantoken generate` for å generere Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, "
#~ "Rust, WordPress og mer. De samme tokenene, i hver økosystems idiom."

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid "No upstream coupling"
#~ msgstr "Ingen oppstrøms avhengighet"

#, no-c-format
#~ msgid ""
#~ "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a "
#~ "GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Tokenene leveres som vendorert statisk JSON, så `npm i` trenger aldri å "
#~ "hente fra en GitHub-only kilde. Publiserbar, semver'd, offline-vennlig."

